<section class="accord-table">

    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)</h2>
    <div class="faq-container">

        <!--   each accordiance start here--------->
        <div class="question-tab">
            <h4>1</h4>
            <button class="accordion">Who is the course for?</button>
        </div>
        <div class="panel open">
            <p>This course is designed for beginners and individuals who want to gain hands-on experience in website design and development. No prior knowledge is required.</p>
        </div>

        <!--   each accordiance start here--------->

        <div class="question-tab">
            <h4>2</h4>
            <button class="accordion">How can I join the training?</button>
            <div class="panel">
                <p>You can join by registering online through the official TEEVAC registration portal. A confirmation email will be sent upon successful registration.</p>
            </div>
        </div>


                    <!--   each accordiance start here--------->

        <div class="question-tab">
            <h4>3</h4>
            <button class="accordion">What is the duration of the training?</button>
            <div class="panel">
                <p>The training consists of <strong>24 classes</strong> and takes place every <strong>Friday and Saturday</strong>.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

                    <!--   each accordiance start here--------->
                    <div class="question-tab">
                        <h4>4</h4>

                        <button class="accordion">Can I apply for two courses?</button>
                <div class="panel">
                    <p>No, you can only apply for one course at a time to ensure full commitment.</p>
                </div>
                    </div>



        <!--   each accordiance start here--------->

        <div class="question-tab">
            <h4>5</h4>

            
            <button class="accordion">Is the course free?</button>
            <div class="panel">
                <p>Yes, the course is free. However, practical sessions, training handouts, and certificates are compulsory and may have associated costs.</p>
            </div>
        </div>


            </div>




</section>


